229	    // This is the exact race the race-safe gate exists to prevent: a genuine returning shopper's
230	    // getRecommendations request is still in flight (isLoading true) and recs has not resolved yet
231	    // (still empty) — gating on `!isLoading && recs.length === 0` (rather than `recs.length === 0`
232	    // alone) is what stops "you haven't viewed anything yet" from flashing during that window.
233	    // Verified directly, not just asserted: temporarily removing the `!isLoading` half of that
